        "claim": "Many experts argue that ownership structure alone does not determine success, emphasising investment and culture instead.",
        "evidence_id": "E33",
        "quote": "Many experts agree that ownership alone is not a guarantee of success, emphasizing the need for sustained investment and a clear, customer-focused culture"
      }
